							<container size="32x35">
								<rectangle fillColor="button" size="32x35" strokeColor="inputBorder" strokeWidth="1"/>
								<widget size="32x35" type="*widget.Label">
									<widget size="32x35" type="*widget.RichText">
										<text pos="8,8" size="3x19"> </text>
									</widget>
								</widget>
							</container>
						</widget>
						<text pos="0,449" size="32x24" textSize="18">No X11, outros programas da sua sessão podem ler o teclado. Se puder, digite a passphrase no terminal (lethe</text>
						<text pos="0,478" size="32x24" textSize="18">ack, lethe unpanic).</text>
